# PHASE 3 — ENTERPRISE ATS WORKFLOW, RECRUITMENT PIPELINE & CANDIDATE LIFECYCLE AUDIT

**System:** FWC AI-Powered HRMS + ATS Platform  
**Audit Date:** June 13, 2026  
**Auditor Roles:** Enterprise ATS Architect · Principal Software Architect · Head of Talent Acquisition · Recruitment Operations Director · Business Process Architect  
**Scope:** Complete end-to-end business workflow audit across all recruitment and candidate lifecycle modules  
**Benchmark:** Workday · Greenhouse · Lever · SAP SuccessFactors · Oracle HCM · BambooHR  

---

## EXECUTIVE SUMMARY

The FWC HRMS/ATS system contains 13 recruitment-related modules spread across 20+ source files. While the UI covers many stages of the candidate lifecycle, the **underlying business logic operates as disconnected fragments** rather than a cohesive pipeline.

### Critical Finding

> [!CAUTION]
> **There is no unified recruitment pipeline.** The system has three independent pathways for creating jobs, two for submitting applications, two for onboarding, and zero for offer management. These pathways share no transactional boundaries, no state machine enforcement, and no audit trail. A candidate can exist simultaneously in "Applied" status on one table, "Interview Cleared" on another, and "Screening" on a third.

### Workflow Integrity Score (vs Enterprise Standard)

| Workflow Area | Current Coverage | Enterprise Required | Gap |
|--------------|-----------------|-------------------|-----|
| Job Requisition → Publication | 30% | 100% | **No approval chain, no budget validation** |
| Application Intake | 60% | 100% | **Triple-write, no duplicate prevention at DB** |
| ATS Pipeline Stages | 40% | 100% | **6 stages implemented, 13 required** |
| Assessment Lifecycle | 50% | 100% | **No job linkage, no retake rules** |
| Interview Lifecycle | 45% | 100% | **No multi-round enforcement, no interviewer tracking** |
| Offer Management | 5% | 100% | **Ephemeral generation only, no persistence** |
| Onboarding | 25% | 100% | **Two competing pathways, no checklist** |
| Candidate Self-Service | 35% | 100% | **Cannot track own applications** |
| Recruiter Workflow | 40% | 100% | **No kanban board, no bulk actions** |
| Dashboard Consistency | 15% | 100% | **6 tables, 6 different counts** |

