### 5.1 Current Pipeline Stages

Stages found across all modules via status strings:

| Stage | Set By | Table |
|-------|--------|-------|
| `Applied` | JobApplication.tsx, ATSScanner.tsx | `candidates`, `candidate_applications` |
| `Screening` | CandidatePipeline.tsx (manual) | `candidate_applications` |
