| `Hired` | CandidatePipeline.tsx (manual) | `candidate_applications` |

### 5.2 Missing Enterprise Stages

| Stage | Purpose | Status |
|-------|---------|--------|
| `Shortlisted` | AI screening passed, HR review pending | ❌ Missing |
| `Assessment Assigned` | Test sent to candidate | ❌ Missing |
| `Assessment Completed` | Test submitted | ❌ Missing |
| `Assessment Passed/Failed` | Cutoff evaluation | ❌ Missing |
| `Interview Scheduled` | Meeting booked but not yet held | ❌ Missing |
| `Offer Pending Approval` | Offer drafted, awaiting sign-off | ❌ Missing |
| `Offer Sent` | Letter dispatched to candidate | ❌ Missing |
| `Offer Accepted` | Candidate accepted | ❌ Missing |
| `Offer Declined` | Candidate declined | ❌ Missing |
