### 5.3 Critical Pipeline Flaws

| # | Flaw | Severity |
|---|------|----------|
| WF-30 | **No state machine enforcement** — Any module can set any status string on `candidate_applications.status`. There's no CHECK constraint and no valid-transition enforcement | **Critical** |
| WF-31 | **Stage changes are not audited** — No record of who changed a status, when, or why | **Critical** |
| WF-32 | **No rejection reason tracking** — When a candidate is rejected, no `rejection_reason` or `rejection_category` is recorded | **High** |
| WF-33 | **No re-engagement flow** — Once rejected, a candidate cannot be reconsidered for the same or a different role | **Medium** |
| WF-34 | **No SLA tracking** — No `time_in_stage` calculation for pipeline velocity metrics | **High** |
| WF-35 | **Stages not synchronized between `candidates.stage` and `candidate_applications.status`** — Two conflicting sources | **Critical** |

### 5.4 Recommended Enterprise ATS Pipeline

```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Applied: Candidate submits application
    Applied --> AIScreening: Automatic AI scan
    AIScreening --> Shortlisted: Score >= threshold
    AIScreening --> Rejected: Score < threshold
    
    Shortlisted --> AssessmentAssigned: HR assigns test
    Shortlisted --> InterviewScheduled: HR skips assessment
    
    AssessmentAssigned --> AssessmentCompleted: Candidate submits
    AssessmentCompleted --> AssessmentPassed: Score >= cutoff
    AssessmentCompleted --> Rejected: Score < cutoff
    
    AssessmentPassed --> InterviewScheduled: HR schedules round
    InterviewScheduled --> InterviewCompleted: Round finished
    InterviewCompleted --> InterviewScheduled: More rounds needed
    InterviewCompleted --> OfferPendingApproval: All rounds passed
    InterviewCompleted --> Rejected: Interview failed
    
    OfferPendingApproval --> OfferApproved: Manager approves
    OfferApproved --> OfferSent: HR dispatches letter
    OfferSent --> OfferAccepted: Candidate accepts
    OfferSent --> OfferDeclined: Candidate declines
    OfferSent --> OfferNegotiating: Counter-offer
    OfferNegotiating --> OfferSent: Revised offer sent
    
    OfferAccepted --> PreBoarding: Background verification
    PreBoarding --> Onboarding: Verification passed
    Onboarding --> Hired: Onboarding complete
    
    Applied --> Withdrawn: Candidate withdraws
    Shortlisted --> Withdrawn: Candidate withdraws
    InterviewScheduled --> Withdrawn: Candidate withdraws
    
    Applied --> OnHold: Pipeline paused
    OnHold --> Applied: Pipeline resumed
    
    Hired --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]
    Withdrawn --> [*]
```

